<title>USA: VF Corp in Chilean joint venture.</title>
<headline>VF Corp in Chilean joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>WYOMISSING, Pa. 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>VF Corp said Friday that it has joined with Contex Ltda to form a majority-owned joint venture to market Lee jeanswear in Chile.</p>
<p>Headquartered in Santiago, Contex is the leading manufacturer of jeanswear in Chile and is also the licensee for VF's Wrangler, Timber Creek and JanSport brands in Chile, Peru and Bolivia, VF said in a press release.</p>
<p>While the Lee brand has been marketed in Chile under a licensing agreement with Texco Ltda since 1975, Lee Chile will be VF's first operating unit in South America.</p>
</text>
